<title>USA: Allegiance Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Allegiance Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MCGAW PARK, Ill. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual and Pro Forma Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>(Unaudited, in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>							  1997     1996 (a)</p>
<p> Net sales					 $1,055.9    $1,112.1</p>
<p>Costs and expenses</p>
<p>    Cost of goods sold			    836.1	 887.2</p>
<p>Selling, general</p>
<p>	  and administrative expenses	   161.0	 168.0</p>
<p>    Research &amp; development			  2.0	   2.0</p>
<p>    Goodwill amortization			   5.3	   9.2</p>
<p>    Interest expense				 18.9	  22.5</p>
<p>    Other (income) expense			  0.2	 (1.0)</p>
<p> Total costs and expenses		     1,023.5     1,087.9</p>
<p> Income before income taxes			32.4	  24.2</p>
<p> Income tax expense				  11.4	   9.1</p>
<p> Net income					    21.0	  15.1</p>
<p> Earnings per common share			 0.38	  0.28</p>
<p> Average number of common shares outstanding 55.3	  54.9</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Pro forma statements of income present the results of Allegiance including adjustments to historical financial data similar to those shown in the Dec 31, 1996, Annual Report and Form 10-K.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
